add("regulation", "regulation", "generator", [64, 65], "What does the lesson vary to control generator output voltage?", ["Magnetic field strength", "The number of installed battery vent caps", "The chemical composition of a hydrometer float", "The number of commutator segments while running"], "Engine speed can vary, so the regulation system controls field excitation to keep output in its required range. The machine's construction is not physically rewound every time a voltage correction is needed.", ["Generator voltage regulation changes magnetic-field _____.", "strength"]);
